If the advanced manual does not provide a clear answer to a specific interaction, you can consult the compendium:
https://compendium.pokegym.net/
For rulings. A key ruling for example, is using the card "Forest Seal Stone" if the stadium "Path to the Peak" is in play:
when Path to the Peak is active, it disables rule box pokemon abiltiies, but forest seal stone is a tool, so its ability is on the tool, and the pokemon is using the ability through the tool, so it is not disabled. This is not immediately clear by even a perfect oracle, so the rulings are an out to any situations that are unclear.
With the advanced manual and rulings, you should have a near objective set of rules to pull from so the simulator is accurate.